# Pinned zenoh-pico (Eclipse Zenoh's C client for microcontrollers), the
# release this gem is written against (it reaches into a few internals: the
# session's transport, the TCP link).
# - `rake zenoh:fetch` clones this exact commit into vendor/zenoh-pico
#   (gitignored), where mrbgem.rake looks for the sources; ZENOH_PICO_DIR
#   points the build at another checkout instead.
# - Family mruby's `rake zenoh:setup` reads this file from its checkout of
#   this gem and clones the same commit.
# - The build options (single-threaded, client or unicast peer, TCP only)
#   are compiler defines set by mrbgem.rake; nothing under vendor/ is edited.
# - Upstream tag 1.10.1 (zenoh-pico and zenohd release with the same number;
#   use a zenohd of the same release). To update: bump the tag and commit
#   here, then run `rake test`.
